{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202140","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120214001:1":{"text":"나는 지금까지 아버지의 가장 자랑스러운 아들은 나라고 생각했다.","source_cn":"在这场决斗之前，我一直以为我是父亲最引以为傲的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE27C6E1B89B9A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120214002:1":{"text":"하지만… 내가 아버지한테 버림받은 형제에게 질 줄이야…","source_cn":"没想到，我竟然会输你，被遗弃的奥格之子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF90D7B52B20A22A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120214003:1":{"text":"네가 군가 축제에서 우승한 건 요행이 아니었군.","source_cn":"原来，你获得战歌节的胜者之名并非幸运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B57685082ED1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120214004:1":{"text":"닥쳐!","source_cn":"……你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38225042382EA62A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120214005:1":{"text":"잠깐, 뭐라고? 소렌이… 오우거의 아들이었어?","source_cn":"等等，我没听错吧？索恩是……奥格的儿子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98A2F059CB032CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120214006:1":{"text":"너희 동료들도 이 사실을 모르는 건가?","source_cn":"原来你的同伴们还不知道这件事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A48F80A7CC4BA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120214007:1":{"text":"소렌은 아버지의 아들이자 내 형제다. 하지만 너무 병약하게 태어난 바람에 사막에 버려졌지.","source_cn":"索恩是我的兄弟，也是父亲的儿子。但因为他出生时太过孱弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF268AE278683AC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120214008:1":{"text":"족장의 아들일 지라도 약하면 버려진다. 이것이 바로 우리 블랙하울의 생존 법칙이지.","source_cn":"即使是族长之子，弱小也依然会被丢弃。这就是我们黑嚎氏族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0F4F271F3324C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120214009:1":{"text":"…담담한 말투로 어찌 그런 잔인한 말을 할 수 있는 거지?","source_cn":"……你是怎么做到用如此稀疏平常的语气，说出这么可怕的话的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x992CCDC29C404866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120214010:1":{"text":"그래... 블랙하울은 항상 그랬지. 인정이라곤 찾아볼 수 없고, 제멋대로 사람들에게 강자니, 약자니, 꼬리표나 붙여대고…","source_cn":"毫无人情，只论实力的黑嚎氏族。你们总是擅自给别人打下强...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282E770D899FABA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120214011:1":{"text":"그래서 지난날의 약자가 강자가 되어 돌아오니, 이제 와서 날 블랙하울로 인정이라도 하겠다는 건가?","source_cn":"而在看到昔日的“弱者”凭借自身的力量变强之后，你们又一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC355401288FD8069","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120214012:1":{"text":"가증스럽군! (말을 마치고 돌아서 떠난다)","source_cn":"真是太可笑了，我要离开这里!","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF331BF656B890D06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库金":{"text":"쿠긴","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}